# ソフトウェアキーボード in the panels the desktop asks with over a program's window
# (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py on a kernel built with UITEST=1. While the
# desktop asks (wm_obj_quiet) the program is told nothing, but the screen keyboard,
# a window that never has the keys, still is: what it types goes into the panel,
# and pressing it does not put away the colour pop-up. The keyboard is an input aid
# (WM_ATTR_AID): it stands in front of the panels, the pop-up and a window over the
# whole screen, behind the menus (WM_ATTR_MENU), where it opened (its window at 270,448): 1 at 388,501,
# 2 at 430,501, 8 at 683,501, BS at 934,501, Enter at 909,590. Each panel is typed
# into with the screen keyboard (and the first two with the keyboard as well), and
# what the panel answered is looked at on the console.
open 01a0d8c4-54b0-7ac1-8cd2-9fab0c1d54b0
waitwin ソフトウェアキーボード 30
wait 1500
win ソフトウェアキーボード
want ok 270 448 1014 718
#
# 1. the name of a new object, from the 原紙箱's own template carried into the BTRON
# window (the first window, a process): the name offered is chosen whole, the
# screen keyboard types 1 over it and the keyboard 2 after it
click 1000 48
wait 300
linkdrag 原紙箱 原紙箱 250 60
wait 1500
logmark
click 388 501
expectsince softkb: typed 1e
wait 500
key 1f
wait 500
shot skb_name
key 28
expectsince desktop: 12 made from the template 原紙箱
wait 1500
#
# 2. 実身名変更 of the link TADjsについて in the BTRON window (実身操作, its first item)
logmark
click 90 88 1
expectsince cabinet: menu
wait 600
move 100 210
wait 200
move 100 228
wait 400
move 180 228
wait 600
click 220 228
wait 1500
logmark
click 388 501
expectsince softkb: typed 1e
wait 500
key 1f
wait 500
shot skb_rename
key 28
expectsince cabinet: renamed 12
wait 1500
#
# 3. 仮身属性変更 of the same link (仮身操作, 属性変更). The menu opens with 実身操作,
# chosen last, under the pointer, held to the top of the screen: 仮身操作 at 100,131
# and 属性変更 at 215,191. The panel stands under the keyboard, which covers its
# foot. The colour 表示領域背景 pressed opens its pop-up under it (its corner at
# 630,422), its box R holding 255 chosen, under the keyboard too: 1, 2 and 8 typed
# on the screen keyboard leave it open and make the colour 80ffff, which the
# keyboard's Enter keeps. The box 自由入力 of the size has the keys then: BS three
# times, 1 and 8, and Enter for 設定
logmark
click 90 88 1
expectsince cabinet: menu
wait 600
move 100 115
wait 200
move 100 131
wait 400
move 180 131
wait 600
click 215 191
wait 1500
shot skb_attr_open
click 678 410
wait 1000
logmark
click 388 501
expectsince softkb: typed 1e
wait 300
click 430 501
wait 300
click 683 501
expectsince softkb: typed 25
wait 500
shot skb_picker
click 909 590
wait 800
click 934 501
wait 300
click 934 501
wait 300
click 934 501
wait 300
click 388 501
wait 300
click 683 501
wait 500
shot skb_attr
click 909 590
expectsince cabinet: attr 12 chsz 18 bgcol 80ffff
wait 800
#
# 4. a window over the whole screen, the message line too (スライド, WM_ATTR_SCREEN):
# the keyboard stays in front of it and takes the press, which the slide does not
# (it would go on to its second slide)
logmark
open 72c584f2-af6c-45cb-8dfc-3f181d13cd0a
expectsince slide: 1 of 3
wait 800
shot skb_slide
logmark
click 388 501
expectsince softkb: typed 1e
wait 800
absent slide: 2 of 3
